WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:11.790
My ion engines pushed me with a force about as light as a sheet of paper resting on your hand, but they never stopped for long.

2
00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:18.300
Little by little I reached the asteroid Vesta, then the dwarf planet Ceres.

3
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.590
I found that Ceres's bright spots are salt.

4
00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:30.320
My fuel for steering ran out in 2018, and now I circle Ceres in silence.

5
00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:35.850
I orbited two worlds, and I'm still holding on to the second.
